WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.846
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:12.158
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:12.158 --> 00:00:16.824
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:16.824 --> 00:00:18.518
Resume complete.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.888
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:27.948
Read-only replay.

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:33.100
Back live. Paused.
